{
  "sn47.13:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 47.13 ",
  "sn47.13:0.2": "2. Nālandavagga ",
  "sn47.13:0.3": "Cundasutta ",
  "sn47.13:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "sn47.13:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena āyasmā sāriputto magadhesu viharati nālakagāmake ābādhiko dukkhito bāḷhagilāno. ",
  "sn47.13:1.3": "Cundo ca samaṇuddeso āyasmato sāriputtassa upaṭṭhāko hoti. ",
  "sn47.13:2.1": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto teneva ābādhena parinibbāyi. ",
  "sn47.13:2.2": "Atha kho cundo samaṇuddeso āyasmato sāriputtassa pattacīvaramādāya yena sāvatthi jetavanaṁ anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāmo yenāyasmā ānando tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho cundo samaṇuddeso āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn47.13:2.3": "“āyasmā, bhante, sāriputto parinibbuto. ",
  "sn47.13:2.4": "Idamassa pattacīvaran”ti. ",
  "sn47.13:3.1": "“Atthi kho idaṁ, āvuso cunda, kathāpābhataṁ bhagavantaṁ dassanāya. ",
  "sn47.13:3.2": "Āyāmāvuso cunda, yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamissāma; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato etamatthaṁ ārocessāmā”ti. ",
  "sn47.13:3.3": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho cundo samaṇuddeso āyasmato ānandassa paccassosi. ",
  "sn47.13:4.1": "Atha kho āyasmā ca ānando cundo ca samaṇuddeso yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho